### List Active Waitlist Candidates
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
GET http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/waitlist?status=WAITING
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

###

### Add Patient to Schedule Waitlist
# @prompt tenantId The UUID of the tenant
# @prompt patientId The UUID of the patient
# @prompt professionalId The UUID of the doctor
POST http://localhost:8000/api/tenant/waitlist
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

{
    "patient_id": "{{patientId}}",
    "professional_id": "{{professionalId}}",
    "preferred_date": "2026-10-15",
    "preferred_shift": "MORNING"
}
